<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-NOVOTNA LEADS CZECH FED CUP TEAM.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOVOTNA LEADS CZECH FED CUP TEAM.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wimbledon semifinalist Jana Novotna will lead the Czech Republic in their Fed Cup semifinal against the Netherlands on July 12-13.</p>
<p>World number three Novotna teams up with Adriana Gersi, Sandra Kleinova and Eva Martincova.</p>
